<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Hanover at $19.50, above range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Hanover at $19.50, above range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name    Hanover Compressor Co</p>
<p>   Priced At			 $19.50</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range    $17-$19</p>
<p>   Number of Shares	   6,613,494</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter     Goldman Sachs</p>
<p>   Headquarters		   Houston</p>
<p>NOTE: Provides natural gas compression services.</p>
<p>Settlement date is July 7, 1997.</p>
<p>Of the total number of shares, 4,166,667 were sold by Hanover, raising about $81.25 million, with the balance sold by shareholders.</p>
